# Screenshots (local testing), in the top folder only. Anchored with "/" on
# purpose: unanchored, this also matched assets/Screenshot.png on Windows and
# macOS, where file names are case-insensitive, and a fresh `git add` would
# silently leave the README's images out.
/screenshot*.png

